Local changes, each also in volcasm-syro-sys/patches/:
- 0001-comp-bitbase-bounds.patch: syro/korg_syro_comp.c, SyroComp_CompBlock
  read pBitBase[4] (one past the end) after the 4th bit base; the result
  depended on stack contents. Bounds check added.
- 0002-comp-buf-init.patch: syro/korg_syro_volcasample.c,
  SyroVolcaSample_Start zeroed comp_dest_size bytes of a buffer of
  comp_dest_size + comp_ofs; for whole-memory data (comp_ofs = 0x4000) the
  last 16 KiB were sent and CRC'd uninitialized (found by MemorySanitizer;
  the stream differed on macOS). Whole buffer zeroed; on Linux the stream is
  unchanged, since fresh heap pages were already zero.
